    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>&quot;C.U.T.S&quot; is a first-person thriller with psychological horror elements, featuring a linear narrative and a playtime of approximately 50 to 60 minutes.</u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A man named Ethan, passionate about collecting VHS tapes, receives a box full of them from a friend. But as he starts watching, he realizes he\u2019s witnessing something deeply disturbing and unsettling.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration, puzzles, and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mysterious atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.poster.avif?t=1753466401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.webm?t=1753466401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.mp4?t=1753466401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>&quot;C.U.T.S&quot; is a first-person thriller with psychological horror elements, featuring a linear narrative and a playtime of approximately 50 to 60 minutes.</u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Story</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A man named Ethan, passionate about collecting VHS tapes, receives a box full of them from a friend. But as he starts watching, he realizes he\u2019s witnessing something deeply disturbing and unsettling.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is primarily a first-person walking simulator, with elements of exploration, puzzles, and interaction designed to immerse the player in an oppressive and mysterious atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.poster.avif?t=1753466401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.webm?t=1753466401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857070/extras/b7f9abd085a9b1ff7981932d17d59817.mp4?t=1753466401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Game Features</u></i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style</p></li></ul>",
